    "id": 539,
    "title": "Find maximum possible sum of disjoint pairs for the given array of integers and",
    "fn_name": "max_sum_pair_diff_lessthan_K",
    "ref_py": "def max_sum_pair_diff_lessthan_K(arr, N, K): \r\n\tarr.sort() \r\n\tdp = [0] * N \r\n\tdp[0] = 0\r\n\tfor i in range(1, N): \r\n\t\tdp[i] = dp[i-1] \r\n\t\tif (arr[i] - arr[i-1] < K): \r\n\t\t\tif (i >= 2): \r\n\t\t\t\tdp[i] = max(dp[i], dp[i-2] + arr[i] + arr[i-1]); \r\n\t\t\telse: \r\n\t\t\t\tdp[i] = max(dp[i], arr[i] + arr[i-1]); \r\n\treturn dp[N - 1]",
